{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02610","headline":"古意六首 四 · 王绩","name":"古意六首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松生北岩下，由来人径绝。\n布叶捎云烟，插根拥岩穴。\n自言生得地，独负凌云洁。\n何时畏斤斧，几度经霜雪。\n风惊西北枝，雹陨东南节。\n不知岁月久，稍觉枝干折。\n藤萝上下碎，枝干纵横裂。\n行当糜烂尽，坐共灰尘灭。\n宁关匠石顾，岂爲王孙折。\n盛衰自有时，圣贤未尝屑。\n寄言悠悠者，无爲嗟大耋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02610.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02610","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}